# Butler Routes - Westfall recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics, designs and manuals whose SOURCE is
# physically in Westfall, verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever item, vendor and drop tables). Nine recipes are vendor-sold;
# one schematic drops exclusively from a Westfall mob (see the Engineering step:
# its source outlevels the zone, so the step says to come back later). Every
# other dropped recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest records
# carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples
# are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated
# to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly.
guide butler-routes-completionist/westfall-recipes
title Westfall - Recipes & Patterns
levels 9-18
zone Westfall
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords westfall, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking — the southwestern shore (Kriggon Talsone)
  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 4305 -- Kriggon Talsone (36.23, 90.18)
  buy 5528 "Recipe: Clam Chowder"
  buy 6326 "Recipe: Slitherskin Mackerel"
  buy 6368 "Recipe: Rainbow Fin Albacore"
  buy 16111 "Recipe: Spiced Chili Crab"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Alchemy — Moonbrook (Defias Profiteer)
  when skill Alchemy 1

  vendor 1669 -- Defias Profiteer (43.47, 66.76), the Free Wheeling Merchant
  buy 5640 "Recipe: Rage Potion"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Leatherworking — Sentinel Hill (Gina MacGregor)
  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 843 -- Gina MacGregor (57.64, 54.05), Trade Supplies
  buy 5786 "Pattern: Murloc Scale Belt"
  buy 5787 "Pattern: Murloc Scale Breastplate"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Tailoring — Sentinel Hill (Gina MacGregor)
  when skill Tailoring 1

  vendor 843 -- Gina MacGregor (57.64, 54.05), Trade Supplies
  buy 5771 "Pattern: Red Linen Bag"
  buy 6274 "Pattern: Blue Overalls"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Engineering — the southeastern shore (rare drop)
  when skill Engineering 1

  goto 75.2,88.3
  collect 264210 "Schematic: Shafety Sheep" optional
  note Dropped only by the Venture Co. Miner (npc1094) at this point, a level 34 mob far above the zone band: come back at high level rather than fighting it at zone level. The schematic drops nowhere else in the data.
